       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "all gaming platforms is live. Many thanks to everyone who gave their feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CHANGELOG",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• The game's achievements system fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixing the \"Get your Inheritance\" achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• HDR calibration tool for consoles (and all other changes from the previous PC patch)",
